ta pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release (v0.01)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Wooden Axe</b> was once a starting tool, being now replaced by the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Axe\" title=\"Rusty Axe\">Rusty Axe</a>. It is the weakest axe in the game, as well as being one of the smallest in the game, the other one being <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Axe\" title=\"Steel Axe\">Steel Axe</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Wooden Axe</b> is a small hatchet made entirely out of wood. It's headpiece is colored maroon red, apparently made with the use of an unknown test tree (<i>according to Akkoza</i>), and it's handle is colored oak brown. Entire model is using the legacy Roblox wood material.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>In early pre-release, alongside the wooden axe, you could also buy 3 other starting tools. These being: <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Pickaxe\" title=\"Wooden Pickaxe\">Wooden Pickaxe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Saw\" title=\"Wooden Saw\">Wooden Saw</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Chisel\" title=\"Wooden Chisel\">Wooden Chisel</a>. These never saw public release due to being practically useless.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903003332\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 98/1000000\nPost‐expand include si